{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"770812c5-46a2-4a5d-868c-7ad168d5f914","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The issue is that the regex `(?=^##\\s|\\Z)` with `re.MULTILINE` matches any line starting with `## ` or `### `, which cuts off the section prematurely. I need to change `### 模板` and `### 格式规则` to something else. Let me replace:\n- `### 模板` → `**模板**`\n- `### 格式规则` → `**格式规则**`\n\nThe `### BusinessEntity:`, `### Service:` etc. inside the code block are fine because they're inside a markdown code block and won't match as line-start `##`.\n\nWait, actually let me re-examine the regex. In the code block, the content like `### BusinessEntity:` is inside triple backticks. But the regex operates on raw text, not rendered markdown. So it would still match `### BusinessEntity:` at the beginning of a line inside the code block.\n\nBut wait - looking at the test more carefully:\n```python\nfor t in builtin_types:\n    pattern = rf'###\\s+{t}[:\\s]'\n    if re.search(pattern, output_section):\n        group_titles_found.append(t)\n```\n\nThis searches within the truncated output_section for `### BusinessEntity:` etc. Even with truncation, if the code block section is included, these patterns should be found.\n\nThe problem is that `### 模板` at line 458 causes the regex to stop matching the section. The section only contains:\n- \"所有 Step 5 注入的上下文必须遵循以下结构化格式，确保不同 Agent 执行时输出一致。\"\n- (then stops at `### 模板`)\n\nThis is less than 80 chars, so it triggers the \"过短\" error. And since the code block with all the `### TypeName:` patterns is after the first `### `, it's excluded.\n\nMy fix: change `### 模板` to a non-heading format. And also change `### 格式规则` for consistency. I'll use bold text or HTML comments.","signature":"770812c5-46a2-4a5d-868c-7ad168d5f914"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1252,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":57984,"output_tokens":